window.products.push({"id":639141,"name":"G-Dragon Sticker Kpop Music Artist Kwon Ji-Yong Fashion King Boy Band Bigbang Decals for Teenager Fans","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s5XmUpriL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Group up, G-dragon fans. Show your crazy love for G-dragon, most popular Korean popular music artist, in the coming year of 2021. Aegyo inches photo stickers are for you to put on every possible place, a journal, a diary book, and so on. The overwhelming charming influence of the G-dragon definitely attract you or one of your family member so that you are looking for sticker like this. This sticker pack is the most innovative, useful, and mindful gift you can offer to your family or friend. The sticker is made of waterproof PVC material with high definition over 300 dpi(dots per inch), the presentation of color and details are impeccable. 99 percentage water resistant Suitable for (commonly used on luggage, laptops, bicycles, motorcycles, scooters, even on a toilet, etc.)Machine cutting, no need to separate by hand or scissors. You can take it off without any trace, and place it (on other surfaces. (surface should be flat, smooth) We use traceless adhesives, which have excellent repeat adhesion ability. You can transfer or remove the sticker with no residual glue and no surface damage. If you're a perfectionist or obsessive-compulsive person and happen to stick the pieces to the wrong angle or location, you can always take it off and retry. Unsuitable for the following surfaces: scratch-free grain surfaces, stripe brushed surfaces, leather texture surfaces, rough matted surfaces, 3D bump surfaces, and oxford canvas surface. Steps to stick:1. 1. Wipe the surface with a paper towel to remove dust and dirt2. Tear off the smooth surface and place firmly3. If it is on the concave and convex surface, you can press slowly along the grain to make it more fit4. Use hot air to keep corners from becoming upwarped","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s5XmUpriL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dolla","source_asin":"B08S7W938R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-639141","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S7W938R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S7W938R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
