window.products.push({"id":639150,"name":"Seikei Stainless Steel Serving Size Spork Flatware, Set of 8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pWZMst-ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ah, the spork. That singular and hybrid form of flatware that one can use in any situation--in the civilized home or in the wild Great Outdoors. Somehow the venerated spork has acquired a rather inelegant reputation. Is it its phonetic resemblance to \"SPAM\"? Is it its rough and wild campfire utensil image? Perhaps it is its dual nature that questions its right to exist. Whatever the case, this need not be. Seikei is all about unmatched style with unquestionable utility. We want to see the spork rise to its potential! The Seikei Spork set is not a simple plastic or titanium tool to keep in your back pocket. No, it is a honorable instrument that could be used daily with pride next to any other Seikei flatware. Consider hosting a \"spork soiree\" to educate your friends on the mighty spork. Send your cousin a set to show her you know how to give a unique gift. Tell everyone that you enjoy a spork-ful of hard and soft food in a single bite! It's not just for the dinner table. Instead of packing plastic spoons and forks, grab your Seikei Sporks for use when traveling, camping, or on a picnic. Show them off with your office or school lunch. It's economical and good for the environment. We do not recommend these for smaller children as the three fork tines are pointed and sharp enough to be used to dig into and tear most anything. For everyone else, grab a Seikei Spork and dig in! It's great for curry and soup that is more chunky than liquidly. Mash potatoes, diced veggies, and anything that needs spearing as well as scooping are perfect. Seikei Designs has a full range of flatware. Check out our fruit forks, butter knives, wide-bowled heavy-duty soup spoons, and many more exotic selections! Click on Seikei Designs under the title to see more and--please--read our wonderful customers' reviews. Have any questions or problems? Just email us through Amazon to experience our awesome customer service!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pWZMst-ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seikei Designs","source_asin":"B01HTZ2SM6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-639150","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HTZ2SM6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HTZ2SM6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
