window.products.push({"id":639173,"name":"Tradeopia Corp. Stainless Steel Insulated Self Stirring Mug Office Coffee Tea Cup Mug Tumbler 300ML with Lid Replica of 24-105 Lens","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.83,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613UQtF1B3S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"When a photographer is in a shoot, who has time to search for a coffee spoon? With the new this Self-Stirring Lens cup, this is no longer a worry!Features: 1. This is a creative cup with the shape of camera lens. 2. This kind of lens cup is loved by many camera enthusiasts . 3. The lens cup is made of high quality material, which can bear high temperature and pressure. 4. It can be used for keeping coffee, water, milk, Ice-cream, and etc, according to your preferences! 5. The lens cup is multi-purpose, also can be regarded as ashtray or the pencil holder. It is a very worthy collection for you, well worth buying! 6. Perfect for mixing and drinking your favorite hot, cool or cold beverages like coffee, cocoa, tea, energy, sports and flavored water drink mixes (and your other drinks) at home, office or on the go while traveling. 7. This 300ML Coffee mug has a small paddle in the bottom so, with the flick of a switch (and two AAA batteries - not included), you can quickly stir your coffee. 8. Great for photographers who like cream and sugar in their coffee, and the perfect size for your favorite instant coffee packets. 9. Designed to look like a 24-105 Lens, the this Self-Stirring mug makes a great gift too! 10. Hand wash only - Not dishwasher safe. 11. Size: D83mm *H133mm Packing includes: 1x Self-Stirring Coffee Cup With Cap (Batteries is not provided)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613UQtF1B3S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tradeopia Corp.","source_asin":"B07YYN5YX1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-639173","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YYN5YX1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YYN5YX1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
