window.products.push({"id":639437,"name":"ParKoo Vacuum Storage Bags Travel Space Saver Bags 8 Pack (4 x Jumbo, 4 x Large), Bonus Hand Pump for Travel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JYQlu319L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Save more space for your closet. With these space saving bags, you will have more space for your closet or package. Keep all your clothings or quilt in order and neat. Double zip seal make them airtight. Squeeze every bit of air out and protect your clothes from water or dust. Put your clothes or quilt into bags, close it tightly with a zip slider. Use the bags with any vacuum cleaner at home, free your hand and save your strength. Use FREE travel pump to pack your luggage when you are on a trip. Made of high-quality plastic, its sturdy and durable features allow you to use them many times. 8 space saving bags, 4 jumbo (40\" x 30\"), 4 large (32\" x 24\") ideal for storing a lot of large items. HOW TO USE 1.PACK: Put items in the bag, DO NOT overfill the bag; 2.ZIP: Press the slider and move it slowly from one end to the other to seal the bag, make sure the bag is sealed completely; 3.Vacuum: Use any vacuum or the free pump to get the air out; 4.STORE OR UNROLL: Store the bag in a roll, or flat it. Storage suggestions for SPACE SAVING BAGS: 4 jumbo 100X80cm (40\" x 30\"): Suitable for storing clothing, pillows, duvet, coat, quilt, bed sheets, towels, blankets, and more extra large items; 4 large 80X60cm (32\" x 24\"): Suitable for storing thin quilt, sweaters, pillow, winter coat, clothes, etc.; Fold clothes as neatly and flat as possible in order to minimize wrinkling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JYQlu319L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ParKoo","source_asin":"B077F154LC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-639437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077F154LC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077F154LC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
