window.products.push({"id":639469,"name":"Creative Converting Assorted Plastic Picks, Colors may vary 300 Count( Pack of 1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uFhszpvkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description When hosting an event with an assortment of appetizers, serve patrons with colorful accented party supplies.Our Party Picks arrive in assorted colors including yellow, orange, and red! From the Manufacturer With over 80 years of combined experience in the paper and party goods industry, Creative Converting has successfully established itself as a highly respected designer, manufacturer and distributor of disposable tableware, including paper napkins, plates, cups, table covers and plastic cutlery in a variety of solid colors as well as ensemble designs for everyday entertaining, occasions and holidays. A complete offering of décor and accessory items also includes paper lanterns, confetti, cello bags, centerpieces, streamers, candles, gift bags and more. Committed to service, quality, design and innovation, Creative Converting can more than accommodate all your party and event needs. During the Depression in 1932, Elmer Krueger, an Indianapolis industrial engineer, took an idea, $250 of borrowed capital and founded Paper Art Company in his basement. On May 28, 1935, the Dionne quintuplets celebrated their first birthday at a table set with Paper Art products. Paper Art soon became “a complete party supplier”, adding holiday decorations, party favors, centerpieces, masks and hats, plastic cups and flatware. Converting, Inc. enters the party goods market with special occasion tissue and plastic table covers. Over the years, acquisitions of quality companies and a merger in 2007 between Creative Expressions and Converting, Inc. partnered to form Creative Converting. We remain so under our parent company, Hoffmaster Group, Inc., the leader in quality paper party goods in the USA. Bring us to your party","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uFhszpvkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Converting","source_asin":"B001BDGE00","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-639469","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001BDGE00","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001BDGE00","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
