window.products.push({"id":639526,"name":"AKOAK 1 Pack Creative Personality High Temperature Resistant Circular Silicone Ashtray Smoking Accessories Household Articles (blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41x1t20vTIL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Description: Material: Environmentally friendly silicone Size(approx.): Outer diameter 8.3cm/3.27inch, inner diameter 7.3cm/2.87inch, thickness 0.5cm/0.2inch, height 2.3cm/0.9inch Weight: 45g (±2g) Color: Black/Red/Green/Yellow/Blue Suitable for: Home, office, conference room, restaurant, hotel, bar KTV and other smoking companies Features: Soft material, avoid scratch table, anti - fall, no deformation.It can withstand temperatures from minus 40 to minus 230 degrees.Washable, comfortable to the touch, harmless to human body Package includes: 1 x Silicone Ashtray Feature: - Keep simple and elegant decorations on your table to make your life easier and more comfortable. - The ashtray is very smooth and easy to clean. - U-shaped card slot: The barrel design has four cigarette card slot, smooth without burr. - Widely used: the silica gel ashtray design elegant, simple, beautiful and practical.Whether you prefer modern style or traditional style, our decorative ashtray provides the ultimate decoration. - Suitable for families, terraces, offices, bars, cafes, hotels, restaurants and other places to use.An ashtray can also be given as a smoking gift to father, mother, friend, business partner and anyone who enjoys smoking. Tips: - Wash with water before first use. - Do not place this product directly on an open flame to better deformation of the product. - Do not cut or scratch the product with a knife or other sharp objects. Notes: - Due to differences between the different displays, the image may not reflect the actual color of the project. - Compare your detail dimensions, please allow 1-3cm error due to manual measurement. - GOOD SERVICE YOU WILL GET: We love our customer, your satisfaction is our priority, contact us if you have any question, we will try our best to solve any problem you meet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41x1t20vTIL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AKOAK","source_asin":"B07WR9QQH2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-639526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WR9QQH2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WR9QQH2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":639527,"name":"Viking Culinary 3-Ply Stainless Steel Whistling Tea Kettle, 2.6 Quart, Includes Tempered Glass Lid, Ergonomic Stay-Cool Handle, Works on All Cooktops ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6161+FU7g1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Viking Stainless Steel 2.6 Quart Whistling Tea Kettles feature a 3-Ply base for even heat distribution that results in faster boiling.  The elegant look includes a cast stainless steel handle that is riveted onto the pot for a lifetime of security and a comfortable grip while pouring and filling.  The Viking Kettle is the perfect stove top accent for any kitchen and works on all stovetops, including induction. Featuring a classic design, these tea kettles bring a timeless look to any stovetop. The kettle body and spout are built with 18/8 stainless steel that is non-reactive and easy to maintain. Because the kettle is surgical grade stainless steel, it won’t impart metallic flavor into your water so you can enjoy the full-bodied flavor of your coffee, tea, instant soups and more.  A thick aluminum core embedded in the stainless steel base heats evenly, allowing water to reach the boiling point more quickly than traditional kettles. The magnetic stainless steel base works on all cooktops, including induction. The Viking kettles include a glass lid that offers visibility into the heating progress for anyone that wants to debate whether or not a watched pot boils faster.  Being able to see the progress of the water as it nears a boil also allows you to turn off the heat when you want to enjoy beverage that benefits from a temperature that is just off-a-boil.   The levered one-touch spout includes a heat resist silicone cover and can be open and closed with a thumb or single finger. The spout's melodic whistle alerts you to when your water is ready to serve.  The handle is strategically placed to keep fingers away from steam as you lift the kettle off the stove.  Built into the handle is a heat break to reduce heat transfer to the handle during use, keeping it cool to the touch on some stovetops.  Depending on how much water is in the kettle and how long it’s been boiling, the handle will stay cool to the touch on induction and electric stoves.  Gas stoves heat more of the kettle itself, allowing the heat to travel through the handle much quicker and becoming too warm to grip without protection.  We always recommend using a hot pad or other protection when lifting a hot kettle until you know how it responds on your particular stovetop.  The Viking tea kettles are available in mirror polished stainless steel for a more traditional kitchen and in rose gold, black and copper, red, white with stainless handle and the newest white with copper handle for those who want to add a touch of color to their home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6161+FU7g1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Viking Culinary","source_asin":"B0BHZQC9X5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-639527","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHZQC9X5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHZQC9X5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
