window.products.push({"id":639759,"name":"3dRose DPP_108275_1 The Chicken in The Purple Forest Digital Art by Angelandspot-Wall Clock, 10 by 10-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":51.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1-lVrtF6mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The chicken in the purple forest digital art by Angel and spot wall clock is a wonderful complement to any room in your home or office. Made of durable high grade aluminum. This frameless clock has a high gloss mirror like, UV coated, scratch resistant finish and is suitable for a moist environment. Sizes available range from 10\" x 10\" to 15\" x 15\". Requires one aa battery; not included. Battery box is not covered.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1-lVrtF6mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"3dRose","source_asin":"B00BWC90DI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-639759","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BWC90DI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BWC90DI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":639760,"name":"HOME-X Handheld Stainless Steel Rolling Meat Tenderizer, Kitchen Cooking Accessories","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kqZnnyHAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASY ROLLING MOTION: The traditional meat tenderizer takes the form of a mallet, which requires hammer-like pounding to achieve the optimal tenderness of your meat. A meat pounder can be tiresome to use and irritating to those around you. As an alternative, this easy-rolling tool utilizes blades that quickly and effortlessly roll over the surface of the meat to break down tough fibers. BETTER-TASTING MEAT: Whether you’re cooking on the barbecue grill, using the smoker, or the range, you’ll enjoy more even cooking and better flavor with this meat flattener. Its tiny blades create small pockets in the surface of the meat so that it absorbs seasonings and marinades more easily. Start spicing up your outdoor cooking today! DURABLE STAINLESS STEEL: Expect nothing less than commercial-grade cookware when you invest in kitchen tools from Home-X. This meat tenderizer is constructed from durable stainless steel, so you can use it day after day and trust that it will stand up to your frequent usage. It’s also dishwasher safe and can be cleaned without hassle. GREAT GIFT FOR DAD: Is your dad or another one of the men in your life a fanatic about culinary gadgets? His home collection isn’t complete without one of these grilling utensils. It allows him to buy less-expensive cuts of pork, steak, beef, other red meat, or chicken, and turn them into a gourmet meal. It also shortens preparation time so he can spend more time enjoying his food! ERGONOMIC HANDLE: While this meat roller is practical and very convenient, it’s also very sharp and should be used with caution. Keep your fingers away from the action by holding this tool by its ergonomic handle. The convenient handle makes this a practical accessory versatile and great for not only tenderizing meat but also for things like baking pizza and other kinds of dough.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kqZnnyHAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B07RYDSX2D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-639760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RYDSX2D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RYDSX2D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
