window.products.push({"id":639947,"name":"Decodyne Funny Coffee Mug, with Middle Finger on the Bottom - Funny Gifts Novelty Mugs 14 oz. (Best Boss)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gEnFk33IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Decodyne Best Boss Ever Middle Finger Coffee Mug Let's face it. Sometimes, it's hard to be pleasant at the office when the workday gets stressful or in the morning at home when you just don't want to leave for work. You wish you could express your displeasure with those around you, but doing so could get you into trouble. That's why you need to have the Decodyne Funny Coffee Mugs around to tell the world how you really feel! From the side, the Mug tells one message, but when you put the mug to your lips, the bottom sends a different message loud and clear. The middle finger image that is on the bottom of the mug will have your coworkers, family and friends laughing, and because the mug has a black and white design, the graphics are unmistakable. Unlike other joke coffee mugs, the Decodyne funny Coffee Mugs is made to stand the test of time. The mug is constructed out of durable ceramic, and both the message and the finger are printed graphics, not stickers. This means that the images won't lift off or peel away over time. You can even place the mug in the dishwasher or microwave without worry about wear and tear. Large Coffee Mug enough to hold 14 ounces of hot tea, coffee, cocoa or any other hot beverage that you desire, the Decodyne Novelty Coffee Mug is perfect for using at home or at the office. The mug has a sturdy, ergonomic handle that is easy to grip, and its rim is contoured to help prevent drips and dribbles. Let this coffee mug tell the world how you really feel or give a friend, coworker or family member the ultimate gag gift for any occasion!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gEnFk33IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Decodyne","source_asin":"B07YNXL2CH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-639947","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YNXL2CH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YNXL2CH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
